# Grok first

- Direct xAI: `grok-4.6` (or the spec's pinned Grok id). See https://docs.x.ai/overview
- Cursor SDK: pick a Grok id from `Cursor.models.list()`. Do not default `auto` / `auto-smart`.
- If Grok is missing from the Cursor catalog, fail the ticket and tell ops. Do not silently pick Claude.
